            <noteGrp type="abstract">
               <desc xml:lang="en">Abstract</desc>
               <note corresp="http://syriaca.org/nhsl" xml:id="work-5507-2" xml:lang="en" type="abstract" source="#bib5507-12">
                  Theodore of Mopsuestia’s 16 Catechetical Homilies comprise 10 homilies on the Creed, one on the Lord’s Prayer, three on baptism, and two on the Eucharistic liturgy. The Homilies are an indispensable source of his trinitarian doctrine, Christology, sacramental theology, and biblical exegesis. They also provide remarkably rich and unique material on Christian initiation and Eucharistic liturgy in Mospuestia, in the Roman province of Cilicia Secunda. 
               </note>
            </noteGrp>
